    NULL, NULL, 'STUDY OF AGNI PARIKSHAN IN DWANDWAJ PRAKRITI', '1. Vishal P. Mahajan, 2. Manisha V. Bhalsing.', 2015,
    'review', 'Evidence Synthesis & Literature Review', 0, 'Background: The objective of present study was agni parikshan in dwandwaj prakruti. According to Ayurved Samhitas references regarding prakruti and agni were studied. Prakruti of the volunteers was done with the help special Prakruti Parikshan Proforma. At the same time agnivinichaya was also studied.', '{"arp_id": "ARP_AYU018458", "portal_id": 18458, "medical_system": "AYURVEDA", "journal": "Deerghayu International", "volume": "31-2", "issue": "122", "pages": "249 - 254", "category": "FUNDAMENTAL RESEARCH AND OTHERS", "sub_category": "-", "body_system": "-", "disease": "-", "keywords": ["Agni Health"], "original_url": "Full Paper in PDF Uploaded", "portal_url": "https://arp.ayush.gov.in/arp/View_Res_Landing_Url?rp6=18458", "pdf_status": "downloaded", "pdf_filename": "ARP_AYU018458.pdf", "pdf_sha256": "ae1e45f5fe0b6c8f5a88eb52ffc87432b08bab85fd7dfaa83f5b0dca09a2541f", "relevance_score": 29.0, "topic_domain": "prakriti_biomarkers"}'::jsonb
